---
/**
 * The Traditional Chinese about page.
 *
 * Written for a Taiwanese Researcher rather than translated from the English
 * page: it opens with 國家衛生研究院, which is how his history is placed inside
 * Taiwan's research establishment, and it says plainly that the PDF CV is in
 * English so nobody downloads it expecting otherwise.
 *
 * The timeline, the publication list and the awards are the same three
 * components the English page uses, reading the same records, so the two
 * pages cannot disagree about what he has done.
 */
import AwardList from '../../components/AwardList.astro';
import CareerTimeline from '../../components/CareerTimeline.astro';
import Fact from '../../components/Fact.astro';
import PublicationList from '../../components/PublicationList.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { routeExists } from '../../lib/i18n';
import { unknown } from '../../lib/legal';
import { currentEmployer, organisationOf } from '../../lib/records';

const employer = await currentEmployer();

/**
 * The faith stream, when it has been built. Traditional Chinese exists for
 * five pages and the faith stream is not one of them, so this link leads to
 * the English stream — which is better than a paragraph that mentions
 * writing the reader cannot reach.
 */
const faithStream = ['/writing/faith/', '/writing/'].find(routeExists);
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於潘威宏博士 — 學經歷、期刊論文與獲獎"
  description="自 2012 年起的學經歷年表、完整期刊論文清單、獲獎紀錄，以及兩頁式 PDF 履歷。"
>
  <h1>關於我</h1>

  <p>
    我自 2012 年起處理健康與臨床資料，起點是臺灣的國家衛生研究院（NHRI），我的博士研究與生物資訊博士學位也在那裡完成。之後我進入製藥產業，在早期臨床開發領域工作十年，既建立研究所需的資料基礎建設，也負責其上的統計分析，目前任職於<Fact
      value={employer ? organisationOf(employer, true) : unknown("current employer's name")}
    />。
  </p>

  <p>
    自 2022 年起我在德國的大學授課，現為 University of Europe for Applied Sciences
    數學與統計兼任講師，並在 Berliner Hochschule für Technik
    授課。我為研究團隊與企業講授統計、機器學習與人工智慧，可用中文、英文或德文進行。
  </p>

  <figure>
    <Fact
      value={unknown(
        'headshot photograph — a plain professional portrait, with publication consent on file',
      )}
    />
    <figcaption>潘威宏博士</figcaption>
  </figure>

  <p>
    <a href="/cv.pdf" download>下載兩頁式 PDF 履歷</a>（英文）。修訂日期寫在文件內頁，因此這個連結每次更新後都不會改變。
  </p>

  <section id="career" aria-labelledby="career-heading">
    <h2 id="career-heading">學經歷年表</h2>
    <CareerTimeline locale="zh" />
  </section>

  <section id="publications" aria-labelledby="publications-heading">
    <h2 id="publications-heading">期刊論文</h2>
    <PublicationList />
  </section>

  <section id="awards" aria-labelledby="awards-heading">
    <h2 id="awards-heading">獲獎紀錄</h2>
    <AwardList locale="zh" />
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="faith-heading">
    <h2 id="faith-heading">信仰</h2>
    <p>
      我是基督徒，這影響我怎麼工作，也影響我怎麼對待一起工作的人。這不是我販售的內容：服務頁面上不會提到，合作過的人也不需要聽我談這件事。我把它寫在另一個獨立的專欄{
        faithStream ? (
          <>
            ，<a href={faithStream}>信仰文章在這裡</a>（英文），想看的人看得到，不想看的人也完全不會碰到
          </>
        ) : (
          '，寫成之後會發表在這裡，不想看的人也完全不會碰到'
        )
      }。
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
